etired `docs/TASK_FILE_FORMAT.md`.\n- Plan-file structure references \u2014 legitimate; SAM plans themselves are genuinely stored as files.\n\n## Note on this artifact's registration\n\nThis artifact was reconstructed and registered by the orchestrator after the dispatched `doc-drift-auditor` agent (qg-t4-sam-task-file-language) reported these findings in a status message but did not itself call `artifact_register` or `sam_task(action=\"state\", status=\"complete\")` before going idle. The content above matches the agent's reported findings verbatim; both findings were independently re-verified by the orchestrator against the actual files before QG T5 was dispatched to fix them, and the fix was independently verified again after T5 completed (see #3151 Concerns / plan P28a09959 T6 context note for cross-references).\n"}